# Print Engine MASTER POLICY (FINAL)

All documents (DOC-01~04) use the **common Print Engine**.

Output = official company documents — not simple PDF dumps.

Source of truth (code): `src/utils/titanPrintLayout.js` · `src/utils/titanPrintEngine.js` · `src/components/print/`

Companion: `.cursor/rules/project-titan-master-policy-v1.mdc` · `.cursor/rules/project-titan-vision-roadmap-v1.mdc`

---

## 1. Documents

DOC-01 HTL · DOC-02 DPR · DOC-03 COA · DOC-04 INV — same engine rules.

---

## 2. Cell Rules

- Text **must not overflow** outside cells
- **Wrap** · **auto row height** · **vertical center align**
- **Never** truncate with `...`

**Wrap columns:** 업체명 · 품명 · 품번 · 재질 · 비고

---

## 3. Row Rules (Critical)

- Rows **must not split** across pages (**Keep Together**)
- If row does not fit at page bottom → **move entire row** to next page

---

## 4. Group Rules

Same **관리번호** · **LOT** · **작업번호** — keep on same page when possible.

---

## 5. Pagination

- Auto page 2, 3, 4… — **no page limit**
- Move to next page when remaining space insufficient for row or group

---

## 6. Repeat on Every Page

**Header:** Logo · 문서명 · 문서번호 · 입고일 · 출력일 · 작성/검토/승인 · QR · Page

**Column headers:** table thead repeated

**Footer:** Official footer text + `Generated by Project TITAN` / `NDK QMS Professional`

**Page:** `Page N / Total`

---

## 7. QR

Default on all internal docs. Exception: 거래명세서 — supplier QR only.

QR Portal → see vision roadmap (V1.1+).

---

## 8. Output Quality

**HTML Preview = PDF = Print** — 100% identical layout.

---

## 9. Development Procedure

Preview → screenshot → PM review → fix → **PM approval** → PDF → Workflow → Commit → Push → Beta

No Commit/Push/Beta before PM approval on new outputs.

---

## 10. Roadmap Principle

New ideas → **register in Roadmap first** — do not bolt onto V1.0 mid-sprint.

V1.0 stability first · V1.1+ per Sprint after PM approval.

---

## 11. Philosophy

*"Can the company use this today?"* — real QMS platform, not a demo app.
